"""
VulnForge - Unified Scanner Engine

Supports:
- VulnForge custom templates
- Nuclei-style matchers
- status / words / regex / dsl
- part: body / header / all
- matchers-condition: and / or
- multi-stage requests
- variable substitution
- extractors
- fingerprinting
- proxy support
- rate limiting
- structured findings
- conservative classification

This module intentionally contains scanner logic only.
"""

